      "trackName": "Memory Match Watch Game",
      "description": "Memory Match Watch Game is a fast-paced card matching challenge made for your wrist.\n\nFlip two cards at a time and find matching pairs before time runs out.\nEach completed board advances your level and keeps the challenge fresh.\n\nFeatures:\n\nQuick tap-to-flip controls\nMatch pairs and clear the board\nCountdown-based gameplay\nLevel progression with increasing board size\nScore and best score tracking\nPause, resume, restart, and sound toggle\nSimple to start, hard to master.\nHow far can your memory go?",
      "releaseNotes": "",
